You need to do it the way it's outlined in the
chapter on missing data in the manual.  So you have
to make that thing you assign to a transformed parameter.

But if it's missing states for the ODE, you just want
to do what Michael did, which is a much more efficient (both
computationally and statistically) way to code the same
quantities.

