Subject: Re: Identifiability in Exploratory Factor Analysis
Message-ID: <1jh0pdZgnDs.qrdaENpkBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <1jh0pdZgnDs.VTdUIOxdBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
