References: <f67hsv-ht3Y.AHJcR8mVBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <f67hsv-ht3Y.7Nt6B3P-BAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/f67hsv-ht3Y/m/eOJfmWQBBQAJ>
