I've been successful using a block of the sort:

```{r engine = 'cat', engine.opts = list(file = "MODEL_NAME.stan", lang = "stan")}
// stan code
```

and then later

```{r}
fit <- stan("MODEL_NAME.stan")
```

This has the benefit of being able to cache the compilation step between renders. Unfortunately, the displayed Stan code has some typesetting issues in HTML, but I think that's an issue with the knitr engine for Stan.

