Subject: Re: [stan-users] Is there a good way of hierarchically modeling correlation matrices?
Message-ID: <6khmjLtF5I0.cTwwYwBpBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <6khmjLtF5I0.UgIPP3BKBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
