Subject: Re: [stan-users] Inference in Stan about a distribution using data informative of E(X|X>a & X<b)
Message-ID: <IbXCPMOt4mM.yG9P0jVcBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <IbXCPMOt4mM.h9WK11BaBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <IbXCPMOt4mM.PpsnyYtWBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <IbXCPMOt4mM.h9WK11BaBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
